WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.307
This video shows three messages of
SWATrust,

00:00:03.307 --> 00:00:05.830
with what each means and what you can do.

00:00:06.330 --> 00:00:09.436
Set-up refuses a period that the model
cannot run,

00:00:09.436 --> 00:00:12.790
before any run, and names the years that
can be typed.

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:15.410
A first year before the model's weather.

00:00:19.879 --> 00:00:21.479
A last year before the first.

00:00:28.192 --> 00:00:31.462
Type a year that the line names, and the
period is taken.

00:00:32.593 --> 00:00:35.303
A folder that is not a model cannot be
added.

00:00:44.393 --> 00:00:46.313
The chapter lists the other messages.
